sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant P as Plugin (daemon)
    participant U as You (Paseo app)
    A->>P: request_input (keys and destination, no values)
    P-->>A: pending
    P->>U: card in the agent's chat
    U->>P: open the dialog
    P-->>U: what the plugin verified about the destination, and a one-time public key
    U->>U: you type, the app seals the values to that key
    U->>P: ciphertext only
    P->>P: open it, check the destination again, write once or run once
    P->>A: a fixed message, for example Wrote 1 key(s) to .env.local
